{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Meine liebe Marie,\n\nI hope this finds you well, along with the boys. We are in Paris at last. The air is cooler than I expected, though the heat still lingers in the evenings. I have had my usual glass of wine and am writing by candlelight.\n\nYesterday I went to Versailles. It is a vast place, but strangely empty; the palace itself is unfurnished, just bare halls and echoes. However, the Trianon is quite different. It is fully furnished, and the grounds are laid out in the English style, with those artificial rocks and little Swiss cottages that the French seem to love. I counted the statues in the garden—there are one hundred and thirty of them, all marble. In the orangery, I saw the oldest tree, planted in 1420. It is hard to imagine it standing there for four hundred years, but it is still green and strong. I did not catch the fountains playing, as they were not running when I was there.\n\nI am tired from the walk. I shall rest now.\n\nYour affectionate\nGeorg Wilhelm"}}],"created":1795220833,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":231,"prompt_tokens":1004,"total_tokens":1235,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-dJkEs5xQUC0vmR7azFc4Cto8Sa3R6UWL","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1004,"prompt_ms":965.5,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9616533864541833,"prompt_per_second":1039.8757120662867,"predicted_n":231,"predicted_ms":5429.528,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.60664347826087,"predicted_per_second":42.36095660617276}}